            "sid": "1SA 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alfajiri na mapema, Samueli alimwita Shauli kutoka darini: “Amka, ili nikusindikize urudi nyumbani.” Shauli aliamka, na wote wawili, yeye na Samueli, wakatoka na kwenda barabarani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walipofika mwisho wa mji, Samueli akamwambia Shauli, “Mwambie huyo kijana atangulie mbele yetu.” Kijana alipokwisha ondoka, Samueli akaendelea kusema, “Ngoja kidogo, nami nitakufunulia yale aliyosema Mungu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.27"
            ]
          }
        }
